<title>USA: FHLMC sets $25.4 mln REMIC series 1917.</title>
<headline>FHLMC sets $25.4 mln REMIC series 1917.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (FHLMC or Freddie Mac) said it issued $25.4 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC series 1917, underwritten by PaineWebber Group Inc, is a re-REMIC of series 1606 and 1491, Freddie Mac said.</p>
<p>The issue priced on November 26 and has a settlement date of December 30, it said.</p>
<p>--N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1868</p>
</text>
